|  The contorted legal proceedings proved a perfect breeding ground
|  for Displaced Mother Syndrome. The mother saw her viability as a
|  caregiver shaken to its core. First, the law guardian urged the court to punish
|  her for reporting her son’s disclosure of abuse - thus compromising her
|  right to protect her child. Then, when the children were forced into foster care in the summer (on the law guardian’s recommendation), it was
|  the law guardian - not the mother or her lawyer - who knew in advance
|  that the children’s foster parents would not be able to keep the children
|  throughout the late summer and fall. And it was the law guardian who
|  recommended, out of the blue, that as a result the children should be
|  placed with their father - even though one of the boys reported having
|  been abused by him. Years later, the law guardian made no objection
|  when the father sought confidential records of his alleged victim’s visit
|  with a psychologist, despite the obvious violation of the privacy of the
|  child - the law guardian’s own client. Finally, with the law guardian’s
